    "summary": "Why we age: stochastic and non-stochastic biological theories (wear-and-tear, cross-linkage, free-radical, immunological, genetic/programmed, neuroendocrine, telomere) and psychosocial theories (disengagement, activity, continuity, Erikson, selective optimisation), with their nursing implications.",
    "youtubeId": "",
