        "h": "Suicide risk",
        "p": "Older adults, especially bereaved or ill men living alone, have high suicide rates and often give few warnings. Any expression of hopelessness or wish to die must be taken seriously, assessed directly, and referred. The nurse never dismisses such statements as attention-seeking."
