          "caption": "The four core biomedical ethical principles applied in the care of older adults.",
          "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 210\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Four ethical principles.\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"20\" width=\"255\" height=\"80\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#DCFCE7\" stroke=\"#15803D\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"157\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">Autonomy</text><text x=\"157\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">respect the person&apos;s own</text><text x=\"157\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">choices &amp; self-determination</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"20\" width=\"255\" height=\"80\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#F0FDF4\" stroke=\"#22C55E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"442\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">Beneficence</text><text x=\"442\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">act in the person&apos;s</text><text x=\"442\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">best interest (do good)</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"112\" width=\"255\" height=\"80\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#F0FDF4\" stroke=\"#22C55E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"157\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">Non-maleficence</text><text x=\"157\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">do no harm; avoid</text><text x=\"157\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">unnecessary restraint/injury</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"112\" width=\"255\" height=\"80\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#DCFCE7\" stroke=\"#15803D\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"442\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">Justice</text><text x=\"442\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">fair, equal access to</text><text x=\"442\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0F4C3A\">care regardless of age</text></svg>"
